FlexPPI

The FlexPPI source code is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Its invariant point attention module is an independent PyTorch implementation
inspired by the Apache-2.0 licensed AlphaFold and Ibex/OpenFold structure
modules (https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphafold and
https://github.com/prescient-design/ibex).

The example backbone coordinates are derived from wwPDB entry 2QHO,
https://doi.org/10.2210/pdb2QHO/pdb (G. Kozlov and K. Gehring).
The wwPDB archive distributes structural coordinate data under CC0.
Original structure report: Kozlov et al., J. Biol. Chem. (2007),
https://doi.org/10.1074/jbc.M705655200.

The MD data sources used in the study are ATLAS, DynaRepo and ITrace.
Source datasets retain their respective terms, including the CC BY-NC 4.0 notice supplied with the ATLAS files used here.
